    <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <span class="text-2xl font-bold">4.0/5</span>
        <span class="text-gray-500">Managed VPS Rating</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Ultahost is an established managed VPS provider running KVM virtualization on AMD EPYC + NVMe hardware across 33+ global data centers. It pairs a wide location footprint with flexible managed / semi-managed / unmanaged tiers — a strong fit for buyers who want managed Linux without locking into a single region.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2">Starting at $9.19/mo (managed, on a 24-month term)</p>
    </div>

