      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-3">Ultahost advertises VPS hosting from about $5/mo on longer terms; the managed VPS tier starts at $9.19/mo over 24 months. Intro price is billed for the 24-month term, renewing at the lower 2-year rate listed. All plans include 1 dedicated IPv4 + IPv6, free SSL, KVM isolation, and a 30-day money-back guarantee; Business and above add unlimited bandwidth and DDoS protection. Source: ultahost.com/vps-hosting (verified 2026-08-21).</p>
